00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.580
By 2050, we have to increase
our food production by 70%.

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:34.430
Today nobody is pining to go
into farming where there's

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:36.050
a massive labor shortage.

