I won't get political I promise.

00:22:38.340 --> 00:22:40.250
And then lastly,
farming consumes

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:43.250
70% of the fresh
water on our planet.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:46.400
And it's trending
towards 80% or 90%.

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:48.320
Now the big bomb that
we all need to consider

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:52.220
