00:47:32.150 --> 00:47:36.290
So we're over in Moscone South.

00:47:36.290 --> 00:47:38.930
Please come over to our
booth and check it out.

00:47:38.930 --> 00:47:40.450
And we'll show you IoT Core.

00:47:40.450 --> 00:47:42.200
The niolab's folks
are there as well

00:47:42.200 --> 00:47:45.470
