about the solution.

00:48:02.810 --> 00:48:06.290
And we'd obviously love to
hear your feedback as well.

00:48:06.290 --> 00:48:10.220
Within the IoT group,
I'm on the product team.

00:48:10.220 --> 00:48:12.640
I can tell you we're
very interested.

00:48:12.640 --> 00:48:15.230
And we are very interested
